}
```

What is logged?
```javascript
class CustomError extends Error {
  constructor(msg) {
    super(msg);
    this.name = 'CustomError';
  }
}
try {
  throw new CustomError('custom');
} catch (e) {
  console.log(e instanceof CustomError);
}
```

